  "bodyHash": "4f8e09d8b3426a05",
  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/700732/description_c1de9fc0-3e76-4363-ae6c-0ff8dc699d48.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"712\" height=\"207\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoddex.gg%252fmodpack%252fprodigium-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1115797175197245470/1508951211183702287/ModDex_Banner.png?ex=6a288b53&is=6a2739d3&hm=6aaa26020723c962b9cbedfae9e18a9ef110cb3012469ab6b531a616585b8dfd&\" width=\"201\" height=\"67\"></strong></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminestrator.com%252fa%252fPRODIGIUM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3W9rfff/ssdara.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"207\" height=\"66\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FDwY6GN4F5\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/discord-plural_46h.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/prodigium-reforged/files/7358173\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/compact-minimal/documentation/changelog_46h.png\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/forge_46h.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252f34dUcLdFRd0\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/v3/assets/compact-minimal/social/youtube-singular_46h.png\"></a></strong></p>\n<p>Prodigium Reforged 是一款<span style=\"color:#f60\"> <strong>以進度為導向的 RPG</strong> </span>，並且<span style=\"color:#f60\"> <strong>深受泰拉瑞亞啟發</strong></span>。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>擊敗</strong></span>首領 </strong></span>即可<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong> 解鎖新礦物、新怪物 </strong></span>和<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong> 新 NPC。 </strong></span>變得更加強大，並看著世界與你一同成長。&nbsp;<strong>沒有自動化</strong>，沒有科技<strong> 只有探索</strong>、<strong> 戰鬥</strong>以及大量的 <strong>戰利品以推進進度。</strong><span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;這不是一個將模組隨機丟進資料夾的整合包。我們花了<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>大量心血</strong></span>在幾乎<span style=\"color:#f60\"> <strong>每個模組的設定檔</strong></span>、<strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">JavaScript</span>,</strong> <span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>腳本</strong></span>、自訂<span style=\"color:#f60\"> <strong>數據包</strong></span>、<span style=\"color:#f60\"> <strong>結構</strong></span>以及 <strong>更<span style=\"color:#f60\">多內容</span></strong>，讓整個整合包感覺<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>獨特</strong></span>且流暢。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;如果你正在尋找託管伺服器，我可以<strong>誠摯</strong>推薦 Minestrator。這是一家位於歐洲的託管服務商，價格公道且效能優異，點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminestrator.com%252fa%252fPRODIGIUM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f60\">這裡</span></a>可享 10% 折扣。</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>戰鬥與職業更新已發布！</strong></span></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/816422945303298110/1182413578360344577/2023-11-25_05.11.17.png?ex=65849b75&is=65722675&hm=d9d44284cefdc25c2ebb16c0d20d1d6fa1118e6c02a4440a9bb3fde8f3dec570&\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/h29pnSF/Plan-de-travail-1-5.png\" alt=\"最後更新\" width=\"800\" height=\"175\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/34dUcLdFRd0\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/rKbGfDdP/progression-sky.png\" alt=\"progression\" width=\"800\" height=\"175\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>📖<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">三個章節。</span> 一次深入。<br></strong>每個任務章節<strong>都會提升難度</strong>。按照<strong>特定順序</strong>擊敗首領以推進進度，並<strong>改變你周圍的世界</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qFCN76H4/chapters-final.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"621\" height=\"106\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>⚔️<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">做好準備。</span><br>在每場戰鬥前</strong> <strong>裝備齊全</strong>。<strong>刷取獨特配件</strong>。將點數分配給你的<strong>技能樹</strong>。首領的設計旨在充滿挑戰。每次擊敗首領，<strong>難度都會隨之提升</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7xTpgKV1/2026-05-01-14-23-19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"243\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>🪙<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">寶藏袋。</span><br></strong>39 個首領。39 個寶藏袋。每個都裝有你<strong>別處找不到的戰利品</strong>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PGk52n3h/treasurebags.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"177\" height=\"92\"><br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🌍<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">世界由</span> <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">玩家</span> <span style=\"color:#e67e23\">塑造。</span><br></strong>首領不僅掉落寶藏袋。<strong>新礦脈開始生成</strong>。<strong>新怪物入侵生態域</strong>。即使到了遊戲後期，你仍會重返礦坑探索。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/N2VfzSRV/unlocking.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"503\" height=\"120\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🏠<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">解鎖 NPC。</span><br></strong>建造適當的居所並配備合適的傢俱，<strong>NPC 就會搬進來</strong>。目前已有 11 位可解鎖，未來還將陸續推出更多。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ynn2gytt/npc-desc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RpcVv3Fk/classes-sky.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"175\"></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>選擇一條道路</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">每個職業都有<strong>專屬裝備</strong>、<strong>武器</strong>以及<strong>套裝</strong>，其套裝效果<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>皆為 Prodigium Reforged 獨家設計</strong></span>。<br>每個職業都會分支出<strong>自訂的技能樹</strong>，手寫的被動技能緊密結合你的進度。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/700732/description_90941f3f-bc5f-4b7f-950c-d5a7dbe8b9c4.png\" alt=\"skill tree\" width=\"627\" height=\"353\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>接著選擇你的職業</strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>近戰</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><strong> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/23Q2HX8G/berserker.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"278\"></strong><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/93p3k7TK/berserker-b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"353\" height=\"77\"></strong><strong>🗡️<span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">狂戰士</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong> 純粹的近戰傷害。魯莽、快速、致命，你自己的血條只是另一種資源。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">兩個&nbsp;裝備效果範例：<br><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong>鳳凰之擁：</strong></span> 血量越低越能匯聚狂怒；血量降至 20% 時解鎖「鳳凰狂怒 IV」。<br><strong><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">結晶之血：</span> </strong>每次攻擊疊加「血腥之力」，每次受到攻擊疊加「血腥之膚」。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fzQrtd51/crusader.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"278\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fG2grtMf/crusader-b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"353\" height=\"77\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">🛡️<strong><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">十字軍</span><br></strong>高防禦力搭配輔助能力。<br>&nbsp;堅守陣地。吸收傷害，保護你的隊友。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong>十字軍光環：</strong></span> 每秒向 12 格內的所有隊友施加十字軍防護。<br><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong>鎧甲女武神：</strong></span> 恢復所受傷害的 15%；血量低於 25% 時，防禦力翻倍。</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>遠程</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cXRvzy4w/archer.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"277\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mC4JGZJg/archer-b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"353\" height=\"77\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">🏹<strong><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">弓箭手</span><br></strong>遠程弓箭，近戰寵物。你指揮陣線，寵物負責肉搏，弓箭負責輸出。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong>獵人：</strong></span> 每支箭命中都會施加獵人印记；對目標施加雙重印记時觸發「獵人戰備」。<br><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong>巡林客之心：</strong> </span>你的寵物在你附近 5 格內獲得「親暱」增益，該增益會反哺給你。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/35nG2d0p/gunner.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"277\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nMSsnSBM/gunner-b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"353\" height=\"78\"></strong><strong>🎯<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">槍手</span><br></strong>高遠程輸出。粉末附魔箭矢。手槍、霰彈槍、狙擊槍、加特林。選擇你的武器。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">利維坦呼喚：</span> </strong>每種槍械類型都有專屬增益。手槍、霰彈槍、狙擊槍、加特林，各自發揮不同的加成效果。<br><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong>霜凍：</strong></span> 每次命中有機率冰凍敵人，並有小機率直接將其完全凍結。</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><strong>法師</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Mk09vZNS/wizard.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"277\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Lh2DRWCG/wizard-b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"353\" height=\"77\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>🔮</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">巫師</span><br></strong>純粹的遠程魔法。選擇你的學派，挑選你的元素，精通你的施法循環。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>巫師點燃核心：</strong> </span>承受傷害來充能。達到 80 層時獲得「點燃防護」。承受更多傷害則進入「過載」狀態。<br><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>天玉知識：</strong></span> 消耗 250 法力值後，獲得「天玉之力」效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/s9KcVLQx/cleric.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"277\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/LDXsMx44/cleric-b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"353\" height=\"77\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">➕</span><strong><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">聖職者</span><br></strong>團隊的中樞。治療、增益、祝福，是團滅與通關的關鍵。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"><strong>陽之光輝：</strong></span> 對隊友施放聖光系法術會賦予額外的防禦效果<br><strong><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">地獄之擁：</span> </strong>對隊友施放聖光系法術會賦予他們火焰抗性與地獄強化。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/CKtbHnrh/exploration.png\" alt=\"exploration\" width=\"800\" height=\"175\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🗺️<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">嶄新的世界</span><br>數百個全新生態域</strong> 來自 Terralith、Regions Unexplored 及其他小型模組的完美整合。<br><strong>天空界 (The Aether)</strong> 是僅新增的維度，以避免整合包過於臃腫。</p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/dwKWm2SW/world.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"120\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>🏛️探索以迷宮為主軸。</strong></span><br>簡易哨塔、宏偉宮殿、<strong>專為本整合包設計的自訂迷宮</strong>。模組內容真正融入遊戲體驗，而非生硬拼湊。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cKsxpHg4/dungeons.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>🎒 來自泰拉瑞亞的飾品及其他內容。</strong></span><br>飾品，其中部分為本整合包專屬製作，可與你的職業疊加，隱藏於地牢中、封印於首領寶箱內、由玩家製作或怪物掉落。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/35Tzzfwr/accessories.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"183\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>✔️</strong> 通關方式也已改變！你需要尋找<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><em><strong>12 顆新眼球</strong></em></span>，它們可由首領掉落或透過探索獲得！</p>\n<p><strong>✔️ </strong>輔助任務線，旨在鼓勵玩家探索世界。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/398/cff.png\" alt=\"地牢\" width=\"1500\" height=\"844\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>別忘了以下內容：</strong></p>\n<p>✔️ 守衛門：需擊敗一波波怪物以獲取自訂戰利品獎勵。</p>\n<p>✔️ 感謝 Better Combat 模組重製了近戰系統，並透過投射物傷害強化了遠程戰鬥！</p>\n<p><strong>✔️ </strong>任務系統甚至包含輔助任務。</p>\n<p><strong>✔️ </strong>基地建造：大量全新裝飾類模組，並附有任務線協助你逐步發現它們！</p>\n<p><strong>✔️</strong> 農業種植：眾多全新植物與樹木可供種植，甚至還有特殊的食肉植物。</p>\n<p><strong>✔️</strong> 烹飪：&nbsp;數十種全新食物與飲品可供製作，提供強大的增益效果。</p>\n<p><strong>✔️</strong> 本整合包內不會出現任何自動化或科技類內容。</p>\n<p>✔️ 光影模組！</p>\n<p>✔️ 以及更多更多內容...</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminestrator.com%252fa%252fPRODIGIUM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3W9rfff/ssdara.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"778\" height=\"252\"></a><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/445/cfffffffffff.png\" alt=\"自訂地牢\" width=\"1300\" height=\"732\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">下次更新與致謝名單：</span></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>下次更新：</p>\n<p>大師模式重製</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">致謝名單：</span></p>\n<p>模組與資源包的致謝名單請見「Relations」分頁，衷心感謝所有讓此整合包得以實現的開發者。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fsobobble%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sobobble</a> - 提供 NPC 皮膚</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/aotv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">aotV</a> - 設計了許多超酷的建築結構</p>\n<p>Lykrast、Stirdrem、Starborne_illness、RamenNoodlesGuy、Kav94 與 Zaracotic - 提供極其優秀的貼圖，衷心感謝。</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Minecraft 版本：1.20.1 (Forge)   模組數：357   <a href=\"https://discord.gg/F3fgvYxYS7\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>   <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fprodigiumreforged.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
